sound H2G.aac
text @[Akio]
text She has a slight fever. It's nothing to be concerned about. Sanae's with her, so don't worry.
text No, I think Sanae-san is wandering around crying right about now.
text But I could tell from her idiotic back-and-forth with the old man that Furukawa wasn't in serious trouble.
text Just as he says, I stop worrying.
text @[Tomoya]
text So she'll be able to come to school tomorrow, right?
setvar strS[1001] = "CGAK13E"
